A pattern whose final segment is a literal filename addresses a directory's index, so the
identity of the row is the directory it sits in — `alpha`, never `index`.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/alpha/index.md --
---
title: Alpha
---

body
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/zeta/index.md --
---
title: Zeta
---

body
-- cmd --
booping query --glob 'plans/*/index.md' --columns slug
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
| slug | path |
| --- | --- |
| alpha | plans/alpha/index.md |
| zeta | plans/zeta/index.md |
-- stderr --
